* WHDR transaction -- showcases EXEC CICS WEB WRITE / READ HTTPHEADER
* SESSTOKEN(...). The COBOL handler attaches two outbound request
* headers, fires GET https://api.github.com/zen, then reads three
* response headers (two present, one deliberately absent so the
* program demonstrates the NOTFND branch). Layout is pure presentation.
MAP WHDR1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER  AT 0,0   LEN 78 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD URLLINE AT 2,0   LEN 78 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
  FIELD STATLN  AT 4,0   LEN 78 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD REQHDR  AT 6,0   LEN 78 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD REQH1   AT 7,0   LEN 78 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD REQH2   AT 8,0   LEN 78 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD RESHDR  AT 10,0  LEN 78 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD RESH1   AT 11,0  LEN 78 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD RESH2   AT 12,0  LEN 78 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD RESH3   AT 13,0  LEN 78 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD ZEN     AT 16,5  LEN 70 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD ERRMSG  AT 19,5  LEN 70 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=RED
  FIELD FOOTER  AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
